IC2E 2021 reproducibility snapshot
Copyright 2021 Luis Augusto Dias Knob, Francescomaria Faticanti, Tiago Ferreto, Domenico Siracusa

This repository contains the paper-era ContainerSim simulator and the archived
result files used for the IC2E 2021 paper "Community-based Placement of
Registries to Speed Up Application Deployment on Edge Computing."

The PESS scheduler is an external project by R. Doriguzzi-Corin et al.,
licensed under Apache-2.0 (https://github.com/doriguzzi/pess-security). It is
not included in this repository; only archived PESS schedules/outputs are used.
